sequenceDiagram
    participant SC as RappelStageScheduler
    participant AS as ArchiveStageService
    participant FS as FileStorageService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant AL as AuditLog

    Note over SC: chaque nuit (cron 02h30)
    SC->>AS: purgerArchivesExpirees("AUTO")
    AS->>DB: archives ou dateFin < now - retention<br/>et non anonymisees

    loop pour chaque archive expiree
        AS->>FS: supprime les documents du stage
        AS->>DB: efface les donnees personnelles<br/>(conserve les KPI)
        AS->>DB: anonymise=true + dateAnonymisation
        AS->>AL: AuditLog "PURGE_ARCHIVE"
    end
    AS-->>SC: nombre d'archives purgees
